    "text": "The given trigonometric ratio\r\n\r\n$$\r\n\r\n\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\r\n=\\cos \\left[\\frac{1}{2}\\left(\\cos \\left(\\cos ^{-1} \\frac{1}{8}\\right)\\right)\\right] \\\\\r\n\r\n=\\cos \\left(\\frac{1}{2} \\cos ^{-1} \\frac{1}{8}\\right) \\\\\r\n\r\n=\\sqrt{\\frac{1+\\cos \\left(\\cos ^{-1} \\frac{1}{8}\\right)}{2}}=\\frac{3}{4}\r\n\r\n\\end{array}\r\n\r\n$$"
